# Definition of Done (DoD)

The enhancement is complete only if all of the following are satisfied:

- [ ] Project Key removed from Generate Report request payload.
- [ ] Team Key replaces Project Key throughout report generation.
- [ ] Project Key retained only for iTrack retrieval where applicable.
- [ ] Scan Job implementation removed completely.
- [ ] UI displays only asynchronous Job history.
- [ ] Prefetch Commits returns both commit list and latest HEAD SHA.
- [ ] Duplicate GitHub HEAD SHA calls removed.
- [ ] Default Branch configurable through Team Configuration.
- [ ] Third commit collection (Previous → Main) implemented.
- [ ] Commit lifecycle analysis updated to use the new commit collection.
- [ ] Lifecycle condition ordering reviewed and corrected.
- [ ] New `commit_analysis_status` table created.
- [ ] Analysis metadata stored for every component.
- [ ] Skipped analysis reasons persisted.
- [ ] Commit Analysis tab added to Release Readiness.
- [ ] Commit Analysis tab loads data only from database.
- [ ] Team-level filtering implemented in Commit Analysis.
- [ ] Branch Repository removed completely.
- [ ] Commit Validation overrides loaded using Team Key + Fix Version + Commit SHA.
- [ ] Commit table migrated to Team Key only.
- [ ] Duplicate branch HEAD population logic commented out.
- [ ] Completed TODO comments removed.
- [ ] Pending TODO comments retained.
- [ ] Existing functionality remains unchanged.
- [ ] No regression introduced.
- [ ] GitHub API calls reduced.
- [ ] Database migration scripts updated.
- [ ] Unit tests and integration tests pass.
- [ ] End-to-end report generation verified successfully.
